        "@value": "A DID plus any additional syntactic component that conforms to the definition in section 3.2 of the W3C Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs) 1.0 specification. This includes an optional DID path (with its leading / character), optional DID query (with its leading ? character), and optional DID fragment (with its leading # character).",
