          "@value": "guardianships",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "definition": {
        "@value": "A guardianship arrangement is the specification, within a jurisdiction, of rights and duties between legal entities for caring for, protecting, guarding, or defending one or more dependents. At a minimum, the participating entities are the guardian and the dependent.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
