      ],
      "definition": {
        "@value": "The heavy-lifting to be done by a trusted (middle-man) party to establish - and then offer reputational trust. An example of such a party is [[xref:keri1, GLEIF]]. Instead, KERI is for attributional-trust. In the real world you need both.",
