          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "definition": {
        "@value": "A collection of attributes or other identity data that describe an entity and enable it to be distinguished from all other entities within a specific scope of identification. Identity attributes may include one or more identifiers for an entity, however it is possible to establish an identity without using identifiers.",
