          "@value": "TSP",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "definition": {
        "@value": "The ToIP Trust Spanning Protocol (TSP) is the ToIP Layer 2 protocol for verifiable messaging that implements the trust spanning layer of the ToIP stack.\u00a0 The TSP enables actors in different digital trust domains to interact in a similar way to how the Internet Protocol (IP) enables devices on different local area networks to exchange data.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
