          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "definition": {
        "@value": "A network of parties who are connected via trust relationships (such as via a membership agreement) conforming to requirements defined in a legal regulation, trust framework or governance framework. A trust network is more formal than a digital trust ecosystem; the latter may connect parties more loosely via transitive trust relationships and/or across multiple trust networks.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
